        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"4050135a-10e0-44d7-a8eb-b809c425f0b2\",\"review_text\":\"Very bad app very very bad\"},{\"review_id\":\"9552f5c5-d2b6-443c-bd00-88ef84406d9d\",\"review_text\":\"I like this app better than others\"},{\"review_id\":\"a1ef7ddd-d71b-407f-ab12-f648e2254fd2\",\"review_text\":\"I cant skip songs now, i got only 6 skips per hour. Like what the hell bro? I just want to listen to music normally, not to wait until song end. Im not using this anymore sorry guys\"},{\"review_id\":\"f84d275b-bddb-41ce-9ef8-ee776a46fcdb\",\"review_text\":\"Mazedaar must music\"},{\"review_id\":\"847a2096-bc06-4721-88b2-fb61c09f3a0d\",\"review_text\":\"This is just too much.. Without premium you can't even play a song twice this is exteme...\"},{\"review_id\":\"e5e0a93f-837b-48ee-95b3-e4e67f23fba1\",\"review_text\":\"I hate Spotify I only use it for a few podcasts I listen to and only use the free version so I expect advertising breaks in my podcasts but \\\"really\\\" at least advertise to me in English all I get are French and Mandarin ads.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3c424ad5-c8d9-4c31-b538-0b3da78ef217\",\"review_text\":\"Whenever I leave the app it still plays the song and since I was online school my work are all in an app so Whenever I want to listen music while working and in the same devise it is fine i can just go on to this app plus it the quality is amazing 👏\"},{\"review_id\":\"54fe9398-6b25-4d7e-9262-9275dcdbc3df\",\"review_text\":\"The app is good but y'all even removed the function of repeat play.....literally the important one....now one needs to buy premium for that?...i guess ads were enough...disappointed.\"},{\"review_id\":\"65095736-cc3a-4d4e-8d3d-7fe886c4ff7b\",\"review_text\":\"I Love my Spotify! Music anytime anywhere to suit my every mood\"},{\"review_id\":\"24601ba3-57e5-478d-aecf-a37c1081a700\",\"review_text\":\"I love this app and everything about it.\"}]}"
